WEBVTT

00:09.250 --> 00:11.670
No good! They've got the surface surrounded!

00:11.840 --> 00:17.040
Let's stay underground and head for the harbor!
If worst comes to worst, we'll be forced to flee the city.

00:17.130 --> 00:20.090
You're under arrest for conspiracy to unlawfully restrain

00:20.090 --> 00:23.090
Her Highness Princess Altiria
and conspiracy to hijack the Hyperion!

00:24.170 --> 00:25.000
Shit!

00:25.790 --> 00:30.250
Do not resist. You may possess superior strength,
but it's no match for our Holy Swords.

00:31.040 --> 00:35.790
Hearing a lowly human speak
in such a pompous manner grates on my ears.

00:35.880 --> 00:38.090
Another accomplice?! Where are you hiding?!

00:38.630 --> 00:42.590
O Eye of Evil, cast a curse
upon those who are strangers to fear.

00:42.880 --> 00:43.960
Vraid.

01:02.090 --> 01:03.960
Wh-who the hell are you?!

01:04.130 --> 01:06.630
Bow before me, foolish peasants.

01:15.380 --> 01:17.380
My name is Zol Vadis.

01:18.130 --> 01:21.960
I am the Demon Lord,
as well as the rightful ruler of this world.

01:24.750 --> 01:27.750
The humans will de-petrify in a matter of minutes.

01:28.000 --> 01:32.340
Devote yourselves to me
and I shall grant you a place of refuge.

01:35.880 --> 01:39.130
Given our situation, we don't have much of a choice.

01:39.420 --> 01:43.790
The remnants of the Alpha Wolf Alliance...
will join your cause.

01:44.210 --> 01:45.540
Very well.

01:45.840 --> 01:49.710
From this point forward,
you will be known as the "Devil Wolves."

01:53.670 --> 01:56.710
I have used my sorcery
to create an underground labyrinth.

01:57.000 --> 01:59.750
This entrance will remain invisible to humans.

02:00.170 --> 02:04.340
Retreat here for now and sharpen your fangs
of resistance against the Empire.

02:04.500 --> 02:05.250
Milord.

02:09.040 --> 02:09.710
Huh?

02:12.630 --> 02:15.210
Ah, Leo? Where are you?

02:15.290 --> 02:16.540
You can't just disappear without-

02:23.540 --> 02:24.960
Until next time!

04:06.170 --> 04:08.460
THE CITY RUINS APPEAR

04:08.630 --> 04:10.540
More and more of them every day...

04:11.040 --> 04:16.340
Leo warned me that the animals
in Darkness' domain tend to flock to vampires,

04:16.750 --> 04:18.670
but can't he make them go away somehow?

04:19.090 --> 04:22.420
Hey, Leo? Are you awake?

04:24.630 --> 04:25.380
Huh?

04:30.670 --> 04:31.960
She's gone...

04:32.630 --> 04:34.340
Leo's not here either...

04:35.340 --> 04:37.920
Ah, Leo? Where are you?

04:37.920 --> 04:40.290
You can't just disappear
without letting your guardian know-

04:41.880 --> 04:45.840
Jeez... I'd better hurry up and shower
so I can go look for him.

04:50.630 --> 04:52.630
Shroud of Deception, cease.

04:56.340 --> 04:58.920
My minion has become far too protective of me...

04:59.290 --> 05:01.960
Her actions very nearly ruined my dignified image.

05:03.250 --> 05:08.170
But that went well. I managed to recruit all remaining
members of the demi-humans' organization.

05:08.590 --> 05:11.500
Another step towards rebuilding my demonic army.

05:13.420 --> 05:14.590
L-Leo?!

05:15.340 --> 05:16.380
Sorry!

05:16.540 --> 05:18.630
I come bearing breakfast!

05:18.630 --> 05:21.540
Wha-? Uh... Did I interrupt something?

05:21.540 --> 05:23.210
Please knock, Miss Regina!
You most certainly did not!

05:24.750 --> 05:25.540
Okay...

05:30.090 --> 05:33.750
Leo, you have to eat your vegetables
if you want to be healthy.

05:33.750 --> 05:35.170
I'll have some later.

05:35.630 --> 05:38.500
How silly, an undead fretting about my health.

05:39.090 --> 05:40.040
Wait a minute...

05:40.040 --> 05:44.840
What if she's feeding me vegetables to try
and dilute my blood so that it's easier for her to drink?!

05:46.250 --> 05:49.630
Crows are so creepy... Should I chase 'em away?

05:49.790 --> 05:52.000
Th-that's a little mean, don't you think?

05:52.000 --> 05:54.130
Come to think of it, they're kinda cute...

05:54.500 --> 05:59.170
You do realize the whole academy's
already convinced that our dorm is haunted, right?

05:59.170 --> 06:03.290
There's a huge black dog skulking around,
and a ghost girl who shows up sometimes...

06:03.290 --> 06:04.920
Oh, I saw her earlier!

06:04.920 --> 06:07.170
Seriously? What'd she look like?

06:07.170 --> 06:09.040
She was wearing a maid outfit!

06:09.290 --> 06:13.290
She had short black hair,
and she was sweeping Leo's room.

06:14.710 --> 06:16.170
Are you okay, Leo?

06:16.170 --> 06:19.340
I-I think you probably just imagined it...

06:19.630 --> 06:22.170
Dammit, Shary... Be more careful...

06:23.040 --> 06:25.790
By the way, Leo... where'd you go this morning?

06:26.210 --> 06:31.590
I was doing some... solo training.
In preparation for today's practice match.

06:31.750 --> 06:34.040
Ah, ya got the right attitude, kid!

06:34.040 --> 06:38.210
And you're always taking care of me, Miss Selia,
so I don't want to let you down.

06:38.420 --> 06:40.460
Aw, how sweet!

06:40.590 --> 06:46.460
Fenris' platoon is nothing to sneeze at, but we spent
all last night coming up with a detailed plan of attack.

06:46.630 --> 06:48.460
Let's hope we win and go up a rank!

06:48.710 --> 06:53.090
This is my first match since being blessed
with a Holy Sword... I've gotta step it up!

07:05.000 --> 07:05.710
Dimud!

07:11.880 --> 07:13.130
That's one for us.

07:14.540 --> 07:17.000
First strike. 18th Platoon.

07:17.000 --> 07:18.040
Sub-flag #1.

07:20.880 --> 07:21.880
Hooray!

07:21.880 --> 07:24.420
Big Sister Selia and Big Brother Leo are amazing!

07:24.420 --> 07:25.960
Impressive teamwork.

07:32.290 --> 07:34.630
An attacker is approaching sub-flag #3.

07:35.420 --> 07:36.540
I've got a visual.

07:38.880 --> 07:39.500
Crap!

07:39.960 --> 07:43.840
Two more attackers,
moving towards us at 2 and 3 o'clock.

07:44.540 --> 07:45.670
Got it.

07:50.710 --> 07:53.460
They've delegated their defense
to their sniper and lookout

07:53.590 --> 07:55.420
while their swordswoman
pushes through the middle.

07:55.540 --> 08:00.880
Using her as a diversion, their captain will destroy
the four sub-flags. That appears to be their strategy.

08:01.130 --> 08:03.710
A decent way to make up for their disadvantage.

08:03.880 --> 08:07.670
But if their diversion fails,
it's going to have disastrous results.

08:09.750 --> 08:11.170
Miss Selia, behind you!

08:13.750 --> 08:15.210
Ouch...

08:17.380 --> 08:18.380
Fenris!

08:18.500 --> 08:23.590
I had a feeling you'd show up...
Riselia Crystalia and small child sidekick!

08:23.750 --> 08:26.380
Hey, this stuff really stings!

08:26.540 --> 08:28.460
Are you dialing it down like we're supposed to?!

08:28.790 --> 08:31.590
Per the rules, it's set to one-tenth of my normal strength.

08:31.880 --> 08:35.000
So why is a platoon captain defending a sub-flag?

08:35.000 --> 08:38.090
I'm here to settle our little rivalry, of course!

08:38.090 --> 08:40.000
Oh, what an honor.

08:40.170 --> 08:42.460
Now Sakuya can run down the middle of the arena.

08:43.340 --> 08:47.840
I'll admit, she's gifted with a sword.
But she seems to struggle with the stealth approach.

08:48.460 --> 08:52.500
I bet she's having a field day
with my Frost Wolves right now.

08:50.880 --> 08:51.710
What...?

08:53.460 --> 08:55.540
Come back here! Stop!

08:55.710 --> 08:58.670
I've sent two of my attackers after your main flag.

08:59.130 --> 09:02.790
With only Elfiné and the maid,
it's essentially two against one.

09:04.210 --> 09:07.840
This woman... She's unpleasant,
but she's also intelligent.

09:08.090 --> 09:12.170
So if I defeat you here, it's a flawless victory for me!

09:12.420 --> 09:13.750
Holy Sword, mode shift!

09:13.750 --> 09:15.040
Freezing Fists!

09:17.790 --> 09:19.460
I'll let you handle the child.

09:19.840 --> 09:20.420
Understood!

09:20.630 --> 09:21.460
Leo!

09:21.790 --> 09:23.420
I can take her, Miss Selia.

09:23.590 --> 09:26.460
Taking your eyes off the enemy... is a very poor decision!

09:28.460 --> 09:31.250
So you don't have anyone defending your main flag?!

09:31.670 --> 09:33.340
What difference does it make?

09:34.340 --> 09:39.380
Then if I defeat you here...
that means WE'LL be the winners!

09:42.210 --> 09:44.960
You know what they say about
making promises you can't keep!

09:48.750 --> 09:50.340
This is the end, I'm afraid.

10:00.630 --> 10:03.090
11th Platoon. One member lost.

10:04.500 --> 10:05.420
Miss Selia!

10:05.670 --> 10:07.880
I didn't come this far just to lose!

10:09.130 --> 10:13.540
I always looked up to you...
I was always playing second fiddle to you!

10:28.250 --> 10:30.920
11th Platoon. Captain lost.

10:31.590 --> 10:32.420
Yay!

10:32.590 --> 10:33.540
She's strong.

10:33.790 --> 10:36.880
This is the minion destined to be my right-hand man.

10:37.250 --> 10:42.960
Oh, for Pete's sake... This wouldn't have happened if the
11th Platoon's captain had just gone after their main flag.

10:39.090 --> 10:43.960
18th Platoon. Main flag captured. This concludes the match.

10:44.380 --> 10:46.840
While they excel at one-on-one combat,

10:47.460 --> 10:50.290
I would argue that both platoons
are lacking in terms of their overall strategy.

10:51.460 --> 10:56.380
Yes, but that charming inexperience
might be the very quality that draws people to them.

11:02.710 --> 11:04.750
Are you itchy, Leo?

11:05.210 --> 11:09.500
No, I'm fine. But, um... I know how to wash myself.

11:09.790 --> 11:12.880
Also, are you sure I won't get in trouble
for being in here...?

11:13.040 --> 11:14.460
According to academy regulations,

11:14.460 --> 11:18.750
children may bathe with their guardians
until the age of eleven, regardless of gender.

11:18.750 --> 11:22.420
And since I'm your guardian,
there shouldn't be a problem.

11:22.540 --> 11:23.540
That's right!

11:24.000 --> 11:26.210
Would you like me to wash your back, Sakuya?

11:26.210 --> 11:27.880
I-I'm good, thanks.

11:28.040 --> 11:30.420
Oh? Your boobs got a little bigger!

11:30.420 --> 11:31.840
N-no, they didn't!

11:31.840 --> 11:34.420
C'mon, kid! Take a good, long look!

11:34.420 --> 11:35.920
I'm totally right, aren't I?

11:35.920 --> 11:37.460
I-I'm not looking!

11:39.590 --> 11:41.840
We won our practice match, milady!

11:42.090 --> 11:48.090
Yes, but we mustn't get complacent. If Fenris
hadn't been focused on me, our team would have lost.

11:48.590 --> 11:53.290
Forgive me, Selia. I was foolish enough
to fall for our enemy's trap...

11:53.380 --> 11:58.630
But you ran into the attackers who were after
our main flag and promptly defeated them.

11:58.880 --> 12:01.500
If you hadn't done that, it would've been game over!

12:02.000 --> 12:04.840
Sakuya, you did fantastic, so don't be upset.

12:05.130 --> 12:09.290
Once you start to account for the battlefield
as a whole, you'll get even better.

12:09.460 --> 12:11.000
I'll keep that in mind.

12:11.000 --> 12:14.090
As a platoon, we could stand to make
a few improvements.

12:14.290 --> 12:16.170
Starting with cementing our teamwork!

12:18.960 --> 12:20.500
Get over here, kid!

12:20.670 --> 12:22.920
Turn around and put your hand on top of ours!

12:23.000 --> 12:24.250
Wh-what?!

12:24.880 --> 12:26.670
I'm not turning around...

12:27.040 --> 12:29.380
Let's keep up the good work, you guys!

12:29.840 --> 12:31.460
Yeah!

12:31.920 --> 12:32.920
Yeah...

12:42.000 --> 12:45.460
Another Demon Sword,
another ruined Holy Swordsman...

12:48.000 --> 12:50.500
Sharnak really went all out with these.

12:52.290 --> 12:57.000
NEFAKESS - VOID LORD

12:52.500 --> 12:55.380
Part of me can't help but wonder who killed her...

12:55.380 --> 12:59.290
But this ought to be a satisfactory offering.

13:02.170 --> 13:07.210
It's almost time for your awakening...
O Goddess of the Prophecy!

13:32.290 --> 13:34.750
18th Platoon, reporting for duty.

13:34.920 --> 13:36.170
Excuse the late summons.

13:36.880 --> 13:40.290
At fifteen forty today, we received footage
from an observation base

13:40.290 --> 13:42.630
located approximately 1,000 kilors to the northwest.

13:42.920 --> 13:47.090
1,000 kilors to the northwest...
That base monitors Void territory, right?

13:47.380 --> 13:48.170
Precisely.

13:48.710 --> 13:53.790
Early detection of a Stampede is crucial, so they utilize
unmanned aircraft to patrol the area at all times.

13:55.380 --> 13:57.130
Ma'am, is that...?

13:57.340 --> 14:02.590
Yes. The city that vanished into Void territory
six years ago: the Third Assault Garden.

14:02.920 --> 14:07.790
If I remember correctly, that's Riselia and Regina's
hometown. I thought it was destroyed...

14:07.920 --> 14:12.960
Currently, the target is sailing southeast
at 6 kilors per hour, and it's doing so autonomously.

14:12.960 --> 14:16.920
Its power plant was shut down,
but it's possible that something caused it to reactivate.

14:17.460 --> 14:20.920
If it keeps moving at that rate, it'll reach us in seven days.

14:21.210 --> 14:27.130
Exactly. And the other troublesome factor is that a
distress signal was sent out on two separate occasions.

14:27.540 --> 14:28.960
Survivors?!

14:29.250 --> 14:31.170
It could also be an equipment malfunction.

14:31.170 --> 14:35.290
Either way, gathering more intel
just isn't feasible with an unmanned aircraft.

14:36.340 --> 14:39.790
Which is why I'd like your platoon
to do a sweep of the city.

14:40.340 --> 14:45.170
Your mission is to investigate how the distress signal
was sent and search for survivors.

14:45.340 --> 14:49.750
Inspect its power plant and navigational system...
and if possible, shut it down.

14:49.750 --> 14:52.380
These tasks must be completed within 72 hours.

14:52.460 --> 14:53.630
If that timeframe is exceeded,

14:53.630 --> 14:57.170
the Seventh Assault Garden's navigational
capabilities won't allow us to retreat.

14:57.540 --> 15:01.840
Furthermore, in the event of a Void encounter,
combat is permitted as a means of self-defense.

15:01.920 --> 15:04.460
Personal safety takes precedence
during large-scale outbreaks.

15:04.750 --> 15:09.840
Ma'am, I have a question unrelated
to the details of the operation. May I speak?

15:10.000 --> 15:11.040
Go ahead.

15:11.290 --> 15:13.380
Why were we chosen for this mission?

15:13.630 --> 15:15.210
It was the Administration Bureau's idea.

15:15.290 --> 15:18.290
Is it because Selia survived
the Third Assault Garden incident?

15:18.290 --> 15:22.000
As the last living member of Duke Crystalia's family?

15:22.840 --> 15:26.790
Ah, so they want a hero. How human of them...

15:27.630 --> 15:31.880
Mankind hasn't changed one bit since I was a hero,
back when they used to idolize me...

15:32.090 --> 15:33.590
I don't deny that.

15:33.590 --> 15:37.170
However, I stand behind your platoon's excellence.

15:37.460 --> 15:39.210
Thank you very much, ma'am.

15:39.840 --> 15:42.960
We'll do everything in our power
to meet your expectations.

15:43.170 --> 15:44.040
It's just...

15:45.290 --> 15:48.750
That's right, he's only ten years old...
Plus, he hasn't been here long. He can stay-

15:48.750 --> 15:54.130
There's no need to worry about me.
Miss Selia, I'm part of the 18th Platoon, too.

15:54.250 --> 15:55.040
Leo...

15:56.630 --> 15:59.750
Okay then! I'll make sure to protect you!

16:00.210 --> 16:03.420
Very well. You're set to depart tomorrow morning.

16:03.590 --> 16:05.380
Head out to investigate the area in question.

16:05.630 --> 16:06.460
Understood.

16:12.960 --> 16:14.380
I noticed something strange.

16:15.040 --> 16:19.880
I spotted the Sacred Order's insignia
amongst the ruins of a city far away from here.

16:20.250 --> 16:24.590
But everything that occurred a millennium ago
was erased from history, wasn't it?

16:25.170 --> 16:29.290
Yes. So I need to figure out
who exactly is responsible for this.

16:29.500 --> 16:32.750
I shall keep a watchful eye on your kingdom
while you are gone, Lord Magnus.

16:33.040 --> 16:35.920
Please do. You're the only one I can trust.

16:36.500 --> 16:39.250
Shary, I want you to accompany me.

16:39.540 --> 16:40.750
As you wish, milord.

16:41.090 --> 16:46.460
By the way, Blackus, I've been meaning to ask
for a while now... What's on your neck?

16:46.960 --> 16:50.420
Oh, this? It was a gift from the talented swordswoman.

16:51.590 --> 16:53.380
Sakuya Sieglinde?

16:53.790 --> 16:59.340
Apparently, if I wear this collar, I won't be mistaken
for a stray dog and expelled from campus grounds.

16:59.630 --> 17:02.250
I'm not sure that's appropriate for royalty...

17:22.040 --> 17:24.500
Feel free to take a nap until we arrive, you guys.

17:25.000 --> 17:26.290
Thanks, Finé.

17:27.000 --> 17:29.460
You can rest your head on my lap, kid.

17:29.630 --> 17:30.210
Huh?

17:30.880 --> 17:34.540
I bet you're sleepy after that emergency summons
last night and our early start this morning.

17:34.540 --> 17:38.880
Q-quit it! As Leo's guardian,
he can only use MY lap as a pillow!

17:39.040 --> 17:41.000
Um, actually, I'm fine...

17:41.340 --> 17:42.460
Ta-da!

17:42.590 --> 17:44.750
It's the perfect opportunity to clean your ears!

17:45.710 --> 17:47.540
I didn't bring an ear pick...

17:47.880 --> 17:49.420
Wait, Miss Regina-!

17:49.420 --> 17:50.790
Sit still, okay?

17:52.420 --> 17:54.630
What a pleasant sensation...

18:02.540 --> 18:05.090
You spend a whole lot of time polishing bones.

18:05.710 --> 18:11.040
That's because using dirty bones would be
beneath my dignity as the almighty Demon Lord.

18:13.170 --> 18:18.090
But the time when I'm no longer able
to remain by your side is rapidly approaching.

18:19.790 --> 18:21.750
Enough with your jokes.

18:21.750 --> 18:24.920
You and I have created our very own kingdom at last.

18:25.210 --> 18:29.040
It isn't a joke. I'm going to disappear soon.

18:30.290 --> 18:33.130
I'll be reincarnated one thousand years in the future.

18:33.290 --> 18:34.380
The future...?

18:34.840 --> 18:40.590
When that happens, will you come looking for me?
Regardless of what form I may take?

18:40.590 --> 18:44.420
If that really does happen... I will track you down.

18:45.000 --> 18:49.670
Even if it means searching every hidden corner
of the world, I won't rest until I find you.

18:50.750 --> 18:52.250
You're awfully confident.

18:52.380 --> 18:55.840
Of course. A Demon Lord doesn't go back on his word.

18:56.540 --> 18:59.920
Then I'd like you to promise me one more thing.

19:02.630 --> 19:08.420
In the distant future, if I end up
turning into something else entirely...

19:14.920 --> 19:17.000
Huh? Miss Selia...?

19:17.250 --> 19:19.250
Regina and I switched places.

19:20.380 --> 19:22.090
Looks like we're almost there.

19:25.750 --> 19:30.170
Poor visibility due to thick sea fog.
Conducting a search from the skies will be tough.

19:30.170 --> 19:31.130
We'll go on foot.

19:49.790 --> 19:53.960
Leo and I will head for the Central Garden
to investigate the power plant.

19:53.960 --> 19:59.090
Finé, Regina, and Sakuya, see if you can
pinpoint where the distress signal came from.

19:59.340 --> 20:03.250
We'll start by exploring the communication facilities
in the food manufacturing sector.

20:03.380 --> 20:05.460
Let's plan on an hourly check-in.

20:05.710 --> 20:09.340
But just in case, I'm going to have
one of my drones follow you.

20:10.500 --> 20:15.420
Hey, kid! Don't get any funny ideas
just 'cause you're all alone with Lady Selia!

20:15.420 --> 20:18.420
Please try and focus on the mission
for once, Miss Regina!

20:19.540 --> 20:20.540
Shary.

20:21.500 --> 20:22.590
Right here, Master.

20:22.840 --> 20:24.460
I want you to escort those three.

20:25.880 --> 20:30.290
When you ordered me to accompany you,
I thought it was because you wanted me to protect you...

20:30.290 --> 20:33.040
Not necessary. Just who do you think I am?

20:33.040 --> 20:33.750
Yes, but...

20:33.750 --> 20:39.000
I won't repeat myself. Those women aren't my minions,
but think of them as subjects of my kingdom.

20:39.380 --> 20:40.540
Understood, milord.

20:42.540 --> 20:43.590
What's the matter?

20:44.290 --> 20:45.670
I know this place...

20:46.460 --> 20:49.090
There used to be a café with a yellow roof over there.

20:49.340 --> 20:53.210
Their cakes were delicious,
so I'd pester my father until he brought me there.

20:54.000 --> 20:57.790
And there was this huge market
a little farther down the road...

20:58.590 --> 21:00.710
But it's all gone now...

21:01.380 --> 21:05.340
While I hid in the shelter and prayed,
all of it was destroyed...

21:06.340 --> 21:08.420
It's not your fault, Miss Selia...

21:11.750 --> 21:12.750
Voids?!

21:25.960 --> 21:26.750
Miss Selia!

23:08.090 --> 23:09.670
What's the purpose of this?

23:09.840 --> 23:10.790
Training.

23:10.790 --> 23:13.170
It's a strategy the humans use
to get the drop on their enemies.

23:13.170 --> 23:16.290
Flying vehicles allow them
to cross enemy lines overhead.

23:16.290 --> 23:19.500
I see. But at this rate,
we're going to slam into the ground.

23:19.500 --> 23:22.000
We're wearing parachutes on our backs, so we'll be fine.

23:22.210 --> 23:23.880
Just pull the cord to open it.

23:28.460 --> 23:30.040
My parachute thing isn't deploying!

23:30.040 --> 23:32.880
Apologies. That was Master's bag.

23:45.920 --> 23:50.000
THE ELF HERO
